-- =====-------------------------------------------------------------------=====
-- HYDE WINDOW RULES
--
-- Preserve per-application opacity and additional floating-window preferences.
-- Generic window-management rules remain owned by the native HyDE runtime.
-- =====-------------------------------------------------------------------=====

